Package: siteselector
Title: Rank Sampling Sites by Environmental Coverage of Target Species
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("K.D.", "Murray", email = "foss@kdmurray.id.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Orders candidate sampling sites so that collecting down the list
    covers each target species' environmental range, using backward
    elimination on a similarity kernel in whitened environment space.
License: AGPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
